config-connector-extensions patch 0039: mockgcp serves zonal Compute Engine autoscalers.

mockcompute registered no Autoscalers server, so every autoscaler request
was a 404 from the mux (found writing ComputeAutoscaler). Get, list,
insert, patch (the fields set), update (replace) and delete; like the API,
the target group must exist, the target and zone come back as full URLs,
and the policy's defaults are filled in (mode ON, a 60 s cool-down, CPU
utilization 0.6 when no signal is set, predictive method NONE).

